{"Light Branch Uses Dark Value: On light themes, `.topic-meta-data h5 a` now uses `scale-color($primary, $lightness: 70%)` instead of the old `30%`, causing topic metadata links to become much lighter and lose intended contrast": 0.7112193703651428, "Group Names Lose Contrast: Desktop light themes now render `.group-member-info .name` with `scale-color($primary, $lightness: 50%)` instead of the old `30%`, making user profile group member names lighter than before": 0.8856230974197388, "Modal Hint Branches Are Reversed: Mobile light themes now render `.custom-message-length` with `scale-color($primary, $lightness: 30%)` instead of the previous `70%`, making mobile modal hints much darker than before and inconsistent with desktop": 0.9661229848861694, "Topic Map Heading Fades: On mobile topic pages in light themes, `.topic-map h3` changes from the old `20%` color to `50%`, causing the mobile topic-map heading to lose contrast compared with the pre-change UI": 0.9434942007064819, "Badge Foreground Matches Background: In dark themes, the background is derived from `$secondary` while `.badge-notification` text still uses `$secondary`, making clickable notification badges render dark text on a slightly lighter dark background and the badge count hard to read": 0.8900619745254517, "Select Button Boundary Collapses: The select-posts container uses `$secondary` as its background, and the changed button background and border now come from the same `$secondary` color family in dark themes, causing the button to blend into its container": 0.8768793344497681}